<p class="text-body text-gray-700 mb-6">
  The parameters in the following table must be specified to design an airfoil
  for a given application. Values for the parameters are usually determined
  from the preliminary design of the application. It is desirable that a
  priority be established for each parameter. The specifications are often
  refined during the airfoil design process. See
  <a href="{{ '/design-integration/' | url }}" class="text-primary-600 underline hover:text-primary-700 font-semibold">Airfoil/Application Design Integration.</a>
</p>

